    const widget = createBearBorgWidget();
    app.shell.add(widget, 'main');
  }
});
```

---

## ✅ **Why this works**

- It isolates your static HTML and assets.  
- The iframe origin `/bearborg/` means **all paths resolve correctly** — no weird `/labextensions/...` fallback.
- No need for extra static hooks in the frontend — the server extension handles it all.

---

## ✨ **Result**

- You click your launcher/menu item.  
- A tab opens with the iframe.  
- The iframe hits `/bearborg/` — your static server code does its thing.  
- All images load 100% reliably.

